{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f560c474555cc22353f7bb93dfa2f9103b88816017ae271ebc73851cc8c479f1","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["這樣說來，猶太人有甚麼長處？割禮有甚麼益處呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["凡事大有好處：第一是上帝的聖言交託他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["即便有不信的，這有何妨呢？難道他們的不信就廢掉上帝的信嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["斷乎不能！不如說，上帝是真實的，人都是虛謊的。如經上所記：",{"text":"你責備人的時候，顯為公義；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被人議論的時候，可以得勝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我且照着人的常話說，我們的不義若顯出上帝的義來，我們可以怎麼說呢？上帝降怒，是他不義嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["斷乎不是！若是這樣，上帝怎能審判世界呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["若上帝的真實，因我的虛謊越發顯出他的榮耀，為甚麼我還受審判，好像罪人呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["為甚麼不說，我們可以作惡以成善呢？這是毀謗我們的人說我們有這話。這等人定罪是該當的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["沒有義人"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這卻怎麼樣呢？我們比他們強嗎？決不是的！因我們已經證明：猶太人和希臘人都在罪惡之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["就如經上所記：",{"text":"沒有義人，連一個也沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有明白的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有尋求上帝的；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是偏離正路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同變為無用。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有行善的，連一個也沒有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的喉嚨是敞開的墳墓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用舌頭弄詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嘴唇裏有虺蛇的毒氣，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滿口是咒罵苦毒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的腳飛跑，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所經過的路便行殘害暴虐的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平安的路，他們未曾知道；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們眼中不怕上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我們曉得律法上的話都是對律法以下之人說的，好塞住各人的口，叫普世的人都伏在上帝審判之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["所以凡有血氣的，沒有一個因行律法能在上帝面前稱義，因為律法本是叫人知罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["因信稱義"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["但如今，上帝的義在律法以外已經顯明出來，有律法和先知為證："]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["就是上帝的義，因信耶穌基督加給一切相信的人，並沒有分別。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["因為世人都犯了罪，虧缺了上帝的榮耀；"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["如今卻蒙上帝的恩典，因基督耶穌的救贖，就白白地稱義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["上帝設立耶穌作挽回祭，是憑着耶穌的血，藉着人的信，要顯明上帝的義；因為他用忍耐的心寬容人先時所犯的罪，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["好在今時顯明他的義，使人知道他自己為義，也稱信耶穌的人為義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["既是這樣，哪裏能誇口呢？沒有可誇的了。用何法沒有的呢？是用立功之法嗎？不是，乃用信主之法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["所以",{"noteId":3},"我們看定了：人稱義是因着信，不在乎遵行律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["難道上帝只作猶太人的上帝嗎？不也是作外邦人的上帝嗎？是的，也作外邦人的上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["上帝既是一位，他就要因信稱那受割禮的為義，也要因信稱那未受割禮的為義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["這樣，我們因信廢了律法嗎？斷乎不是！更是堅固律法。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"有古卷：因為","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":28}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ROM/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}